        "gu_earth_treasury_flower_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The needed technique is called one after another. Its purpose is to entwine every stalk of upstream grass with every strand of zen lion’s mane. For earth treasury flower Gu, a hundred stalks and strands must be woven together within thirty breaths; beyond that time, the Gu refinement fire burns the stalks and strands to ashes.",
